## 5. Areas of Expertise

Klaud provides specialized consulting services across VMware Cloud Foundation, private cloud, hybrid cloud, and advanced infrastructure technologies. Our focus is on complex environments where deep technical knowledge, architecture experience, and operational understanding are required to deliver successful outcomes.

Klaud’s expertise covers the full lifecycle of private cloud initiatives, including assessment, design, deployment, upgrade, migration, optimization, troubleshooting, and knowledge transfer.

### 5.1 VMware Cloud Foundation

Klaud supports partners with the design, deployment, upgrade, and operationalization of VMware Cloud Foundation environments.

This includes:

* VCF architecture and design
* Management domain and workload domain planning
* Workload domain deployment
* VCF lifecycle management
* VCF upgrades and patching strategy
* VCF Operations integration
* VCF Automation integration
* VCF environment validation
* VCF operational readiness
* VCF troubleshooting and stabilization

